        "title": "Route o1 through OpenRouter",
        "summary": "Switched `o1` model routing to OpenRouter backend, replacing direct API usage. Added `open-router.ts` to handle streaming completions via `openai/o1` prefix and `OPEN_ROUTER_API_KEY` env var. Updated `planning.ts` imports and `constants.ts` to use `o1-2024-12-17`. Scope includes backend routing logic, environment validation, and shared model definitions.",
